screen.XON_LIGHT=Lighting
screen.XON_LIGHT.comment=Sun, moon, ordinary lamps, held light and dark-area visibility.
screen.XON_EMISSIVE=Colored Block Light
screen.XON_EMISSIVE.comment=Colored spill from ores, crystals, quartz, sculk, glowing plants, jack-o-lanterns and soul lanterns. Surface glow is controlled separately below.
screen.XON_COLOR=Color & Bloom
screen.XON_COLOR.comment=Overall brightness, world color, the XON grade and soft highlight halos.
screen.XON_SHADOW_SETTINGS=Shadows
screen.XON_SHADOW_SETTINGS.comment=Sun and moon cast shadows: quality, distance and transitions.
screen.XON_SKY=Sky & Atmosphere
screen.XON_SKY.comment=Clouds, moving cloud shade, distant fog and the End sky.
screen.XON_CLOUD_SETTINGS=Cloud Formations
screen.XON_CLOUD_SETTINGS.comment=Evolving cumulus, rippled cloudlets and stretched veils. All formations share the existing noise and lighting samples.
screen.XON_END_SKY=End Sky
screen.XON_END_SKY.comment=Blue-violet galaxies, fine stars and a golden black hole with an accretion disk and lensed light arcs.
screen.XON_WATER=Water & Plants
screen.XON_WATER.comment=Water waves, underwater effects and wind in plants and leaves.
screen.XON_RAYS=Light Rays
screen.XON_RAYS.comment=Outdoor and underwater sunlight shafts. Both require Cast Shadows; underwater rays also require Sun Rays.
screen.XON_CAMERA=Camera & Detail
screen.XON_CAMERA.comment=Texture filtering, sharpening, camera blur and block outlines. Edge smoothing is always built in.
screen.XON_PERFORMANCE=Performance
screen.XON_PERFORMANCE.comment=Quick access to costly effects. These are the same controls used on the other pages. Start with the Speed preset for fewer effects.

